    "description": "Help › Transpose & chords › What it changes — point 4"
  },
  "helpTransposeS2P5": "A Carnatic or Hindustani song has no transpose control, because swaras are named relative to Sa and do not move.",
  "@helpTransposeS2P5": {
    "description": "Help › Transpose & chords › What it changes — point 5"
