    "description": "Help › Transpose & chords › Chord Reference — point 1"
  },
  "helpTransposeS4P2": "Each chord is drawn two ways: a six-string guitar fretboard with finger dots and O and X marks for open and muted strings, and a harmonium or piano keyboard with the notes lit up.",
